      "confidence": "high",
      "coverage_note": "What a widget builds with, for the `const X(...)` / `new X(...)` spelling Flutter's own lints prefer. The target is the name node, so it meets the declaration of that widget wherever in the project it lives. The exclusion list is the value types a const expression commonly constructs that are not widgets."
