      "confidence": "exact",
      "coverage_note": "Which widget has the app shell, which one is a screen with a Scaffold, which one drives a StreamBuilder or a Navigator. A bare `Scaffold(...)` is a call.function in Dart, so a name list is what separates a widget construction from any other call in a build method; the list is Flutter's own structural vocabulary."
